Two templates the module applies setting one value differently.
--- module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
apply: [ a.module-template.yaml, b.module-template.yaml ]
--- a.module-template.yaml
settings:
  jvm:
    release: 21
--- b.module-template.yaml
settings:
  jvm:
    release: 22
--- expected
ERROR: Conflicting values for property `release` in context [module.yaml]:\n  - `21`, defined at:\n    ╰─ a.module-template.yaml:3:14\n  - `22`, defined at:\n    ╰─ b.module-template.yaml:3:14
